# CR 700.13 and CR 707.10: a copy of a spell is not cast, so it commits no crime even when its new target is an
# opponent's creature. Bot1's Lightning Bolt targets only Bot1's own Llanowar Elves (no crime); Leyline of Resonance
# copies it and Bot1 aims the copy at Bot2's Llanowar Elves. Bot2's Elves dies, and Bot1 has committed no crime:
# Raven of Fell Omens never triggers (Bot2 at 20).

[Bot1 Deck]
Leyline of Resonance
Forest
Mountain
Swamp
Llanowar Elves
Lightning Bolt
Raven of Fell Omens
Mox Jet
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x18

